@startuml product-list-presentation-sequence
' 商品一覧（ProductList）プレゼンテーション層のシーケンス図
' Load（読み込み）と ClickProduct（詳細画面への遷移）の流れ

title ProductList プレゼンテーション層（シーケンス図）

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
autonumber

box "UI（Android: ViewModel + Compose / iOS: Observable + SwiftUI）" #E8F5E9
  actor User
  participant "UI" as UI
end box

box "shared / presentation" #FFF8E1
  participant "ProductListStore" as PStore
  participant "Store\n<<internal>>" as Store
  participant "ProductListProcessor\n<<internal>>" as Processor
  participant "ProductListReducer\n<<internal>>" as Reducer
end box

box "shared / domain" #F3E5F5
  participant "GetProductsUseCase" as UseCase
end box

== 初期化 ==
UI -> PStore : KmpSdk.createProductListStore(scope)\n（Android: viewModelScope / iOS: storeScope()）
activate PStore
PStore -> Store : Store(initialState, processor, reducer, scope)
deactivate PStore
UI -> PStore : state / sideEffect を監視\n（Android: collectAsStateWithLifecycle / iOS: for await（SKIE））

== Load（読み込み） ==
UI -> PStore : dispatch(ProductListIntent.Load)
PStore -> Store : dispatch(intent)
activate Store
Store -> Processor : process(Load)
activate Processor

Processor --> Store : emit(Action(LoadStarted))
Store -> Reducer : reduce(state, LoadStarted)
Reducer --> Store : state.copy(isLoading = true, errorMessage = null)
Store --> UI : state 更新（ローディング表示）

Processor -> UseCase : invoke()
activate UseCase
UseCase --> Processor : DomainResult
deactivate UseCase

alt DomainResult.Success
  Processor --> Store : emit(Action(LoadSucceeded(products)))
  Store -> Reducer : reduce(state, LoadSucceeded)
  Reducer --> Store : state.copy(isLoading = false, products = products)
  Store --> UI : state 更新（一覧表示）
else DomainResult.Error
  Processor --> Store : emit(Action(LoadFailed(message)))
  Store -> Reducer : reduce(state, LoadFailed)
  Reducer --> Store : state.copy(isLoading = false, errorMessage = message)
  Store --> UI : state 更新（エラー・再読み込みボタン）
end
deactivate Processor
deactivate Store

== ClickProduct（詳細画面への遷移） ==
User -> UI : 商品をタップ
UI -> PStore : dispatch(ProductListIntent.ClickProduct(id))
PStore -> Store : dispatch(intent)
activate Store
Store -> Processor : process(ClickProduct(id))
activate Processor
Processor --> Store : emit(SideEffect(NavigateToDetail(id)))
deactivate Processor
note right of Store
  SideEffect は Reducer を通らず、
  Channel 経由で 1 回だけ UI に届く
end note
Store --> UI : sideEffect: NavigateToDetail(id)
deactivate Store
UI -> UI : 詳細画面へ遷移\n（Android: onNavigateToDetail / iOS: navigateToDetailId）

== 破棄 ==
alt Android
  UI -> UI : ViewModel 破棄で viewModelScope が自動キャンセル
else iOS
  UI -> PStore : close()（ProductListObservable の deinit）
  PStore -> Store : close() → scope.cancel()
end

@enduml
